      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انفغم</span></b> , said of a <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُكَام</span> [or defluxion from the
head], <i>It was,</i> or <i>became, removed, cleared away,</i>
or <i>dispelled;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْفَرَجَ</span>; (K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افتغم</span></b> .
